            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past experiences with music, including any instruments played, genres enjoyed, or creative activities like composing or performing?\",\"output_slot\":\"music_history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past experiences with music, including any instruments played, genres enjoyed, or creative activities like composing or performing?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"57c76d45f960228cfd896d6899382074f02854572107a8974f57ded396732c55\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"38abc1cbe6f4e54345cbc51b5cecca318db8ffa7e8cb4a29004943cbf6199004\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"ebe16fc62762fbc36d68aff3114babb2e96faf4ed37adf65ab0c54b2a80c954c\"},\"variables\":{\"music_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"music_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"music_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_4003bdfd9aa4fccf10cf65dc\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has explored various genres and attended festivals, including an electronic music festival in 2017. They tried learning music theory in 2018 but found it unfulfilling, preferring emotional connection over technical analysis. They attempted researching historical music trends in 2020, which felt tedious. They also explored audio production techniques but found it a chore. They have created their own tracks, which brings joy and satisfaction. They watched a music documentary that felt unsatisfying. They have not played an instrument or composed in a formal sense, but they have engaged in creative activities like making playlists and creating original music.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s47\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's statements across multiple conversations describe past experiences with music: attending an electronic music festival in 2017 (s31, s32), trying music theory in 2018 (s33, s34), researching historical music trends in 2020 (s10, s11), exploring audio production (s43, s44), creating their own tracks (s45, s46, s47), watching a documentary (s22, s23, s47), and engaging with genres, playlists, and cultural exploration (s3, s4, s13, s14). No instrument playing or formal composition is mentioned.\",\"variable\":\"music_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",105,364,\"User: Yes, I attended another festival in 2017 that showcased electronic music, which was also eye-opening. The creativity displayed at that festival was nothing short of spectacular, with artists pushing the boundaries of sound in ways I had never imagined. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",364,655,\"There were vibrant visuals accompanying the music, and it felt like each performance was not just an auditory experience, but also a feast for the eyes. The diversity of electronic subgenres was a revelation; it really made me appreciate how broad and eclectic the music landscape is today. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",655,985,\"Each artist brought their own unique flavor, and it was thrilling to see how they engaged with the audience in real-time.\\n\\nUser: However, I realized that analyzing music theory wasn't my forte in 2018. As I sat through various classes, I found myself more focused on the emotional aspects of music rather than the technicalities. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",985,1287,\"It became evident that while I loved understanding how music is composed, diving into the intricacies of scales, modes, and harmonic structures just didn't resonate with me. Perhaps it was the way I primarily experienced music— through listening and feeling rather than dissecting the notes on a page. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s49\",\"d5\",1699,2074,\"Assistant: I completely understand where you're coming from, as focusing on your personal inspirations can lead to much more fulfilling creative experiences. When you channel your energy into producing music that resonates with you, it sets the stage for a more meaningful artistic journey, one where every note and beat are imbued with your unique perspective and emotions. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s50\",\"d5\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s51\",\"d5\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s52\",\"d5\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 163–164 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",749,762,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s58\",\"d6\",762,1136,\"Assistant: That's a fantastic approach to integrate your culture into your music. When you incorporate traditional elements, you not only honor your heritage but also make a significant contribution to contemporary music as a whole. It might be worthwhile to consider how your unique musical perspective can inspire others who are also on a journey of cultural exploration. \",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",1136,1386,\"Have you thought about sharing your work more publicly? For instance, setting up an online platform could broaden your audience, and it might provide an opportunity for meaningful engagement with listeners who share similar backgrounds or interests. \",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s60\",\"d6\",1386,1585,\"You could also explore partnerships with community organizations to enhance visibility and create a supportive network around your music, which could lead to exciting collaborations and new projects.\",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 81–82 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s65\",\"d7\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s66\",\"d7\",817,830,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s67\",\"d7\",830,1178,\"Assistant: That sounds beautiful! Nature can inspire such unique musical elements, providing textures and layers that are often hard to replicate with traditional instruments alone. It’s fascinating how something as simple as the rustling of leaves or the chirping of birds can evoke powerful emotions and influence the direction of a composition. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s68\",\"d7\",1178,1415,\"Have you thought about collaborating with other musicians on this? Working with others who share your passion for blending genres can lead to remarkable synergies, where each artist’s strengths complement one another in unexpected ways. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s69\",\"d7\",1415,1777,\"Collaborations can also introduce you to new techniques, sounds, and ideas that could elevate your projects even further, especially in a band setting where different styles can creatively clash and harmonize. Plus, sharing your musical journey with others can lead to a richer experience, as you exchange not just sounds but stories behind every note and beat. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s70\",\"d7\",1777,1897,\"I would love to learn more about your experiences in these collaborations and how they impact your music-making process.\",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s71\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 16–17 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s72\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s73\",\"d8\",105,418,\"User: It was fulfilling to share knowledge and inspire others. The joy that comes from seeing the lightbulb moment when someone understands a new concept is incredibly rewarding. Sharing my experiences and insights felt like passing on a torch, igniting curiosity and passion in the next generation of musicians. \",\"user\",[16]],[\"s74\",\"d8\",418,663,\"It was heartwarming to witness the enthusiasm and creativity bubbling up from young talents who were eager to learn. Each interaction was a reminder of the beauty of music and how it can connect people across various backgrounds and experiences.\",\"user\",[16]],[\"s75\",\"d8\",663,676,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d8\",676,1068,\"Assistant: That's a wonderful way to give back to the community! It takes a special kind of person to freely share their knowledge and skills, and your commitment to nurturing young talent is commendable. Did that experience influence your music as well? It’s fascinating how teaching others often reinforces our own learning and growth, allowing us to see our craft from fresh perspectives. \",\"assistant\",[17]],[\"s77\",\"d8\",1068,1385,\"Engaging with students can introduce different styles and techniques that we may not have considered before, ultimately enriching your own artistry. Furthermore, it builds a bond within the community, fostering collaboration and mutual support among musicians, making the local music scene thrive even more vibrantly.\",\"assistant\",[17]],[\"s78\",\"d9\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 45–46 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s79\",\"d9\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s80\",\"d9\",105,408,\"User: Now, I’m focusing on blending my traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app that helps others do the same. This exciting endeavor allows me to explore the rich heritage of my musical upbringing while also embracing contemporary genres that resonate with today's audiences. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s81\",\"d9\",408,640,\"By experimenting with various elements, such as instrumentation and digital production techniques, I am able to create a unique sound that pays homage to my roots while also pushing the boundaries of what is traditionally expected. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s82\",\"d9\",640,1002,\"Additionally, this app I am developing aims not only to assist me but also to empower others who share similar aspirations by providing tools, tutorials, and resources that inspire creativity. I believe that by combining our musical histories with modern technology, we can create something truly transformative, both personally and in the wider music community.\",\"user\",[45]],[\"s83\",\"d9\",1002,1015,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s84\",\"d9\",1015,1389,\"Assistant: That sounds like an incredible project! Your journey is a testament to how evolving interests can lead to more fulfilling experiences. The intersection of traditional and modern music is indeed a fertile ground for innovation, and your initiative reflects a deep understanding of both worlds, allowing different generations of listeners to connect through sound. \",\"assistant\",[46]],[\"s85\",\"d9\",1389,1708,\"It's fascinating to consider how technology can serve as a bridge, translating age-old techniques into contemporary forms that resonate today. Whether it’s through sampling classic melodies or integrating traditional instruments into electronic music, there’s a rich canvas for creativity that you are keen to explore. \",\"assistant\",[46]],[\"s86\",\"d9\",1708,1902,\"Moreover, developing an app adds another layer of engagement, as it demonstrates your commitment to sharing this journey with the community and fostering collaboration among aspiring musicians. \",\"assistant\",[46]],[\"s87\",\"d9\",1902,2114,\"The potential for cross-cultural exchange through your project is significant, as you could inspire many who might feel disconnected from their musical heritage to reclaim and reinvent it through modern avenues. \",\"assistant\",[46]],[\"s88\",\"d9\",2114,2490,\"As you embark on this path, remember that your unique voice and experience will offer invaluable insights to those who engage with your app, making it not just a tool but also a platform for dialogue and creativity. I'm excited to see how your vision unfolds and hope to hear more about the innovative ways you're integrating those traditional elements into a new soundscape. \",\"assistant\",[46]],[\"s89\",\"d9\",2490,2601,\"Truly, your efforts are more than just projects; they are bridges connecting the past with the future of music.\",\"assistant\",[46]],[\"s90\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 52–53 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s91\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s92\",\"d10\",105,484,\"User: I found a new book that explains concepts through Pacific music examples, and it really ignited my interest! The book goes into incredible detail about the unique scales and timbres that are characteristic of Pacific Islander music, which is just fascinating to me. It's amazing how music can not only entertain but also teach us about the history and culture of a region. \",\"user\",[52]],[\"s93\",\"d10\",484,668,\"I have always wanted to understand more about my own heritage, and this book provided that bridge. I feel like I am taking steps toward a richer connection with my roots through music.\",\"user\",[52]],[\"s94\",\"d10\",668,681,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s95\",\"d10\",681,1001,\"Assistant: It's wonderful to see how integrating your heritage can change your perspective on music theory. Exploring the intricacies of music through the lens of your own background can really enhance your understanding and appreciation, opening up avenues for creativity that resonate deeply with personal experience. \",\"assistant\",[53]],[\"s96\",\"d10\",1001,1311,\"Music has a unique way of telling stories and conveying emotions that often speak louder than words. By diving into the theories and structures that govern Pacific Islander music, you not only enrich your academic knowledge but also cultivate a profound sense of identity. How are you applying that knowledge? \",\"assistant\",[53]],[\"s97\",\"d10\",1311,1424,\"Have you begun to incorporate any specific techniques into your own work or projects that you've been developing?\",\"assistant\",[53]],[\"s98\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 179–180 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s99\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s100\",\"d11\",107,486,\"User: It was an enriching experience, and we created some exciting pieces together! The energy in the room was palpable as musicians from different backgrounds shared their unique styles and techniques, weaving together melodies that resonated with everyone present. Each note seemed to tell a story, reflecting the diverse cultural influences that shaped the sounds we created. \",\"user\",[179]],[\"s101\",\"d11\",486,666,\"I found it fascinating how music can serve as a universal language, bridging gaps and fostering connections among individuals who may come from completely different walks of life. \",\"user\",[179]],[\"s102\",\"d11\",666,919,\"Lately, I've been delving deeper into this theme by watching a series of documentaries that showcase the evolution of cultural music around the world, exploring how geography, history, and social movements have influenced various genres throughout time.\",\"user\",[179]],[\"s103\",\"d11\",919,932,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s104\",\"d11\",932,1240,\"Assistant: That sounds like an absolutely incredible experience, one that no doubt left a lasting impact on everyone involved. The collaborative energy that arises when artists share their insights and skills is often transformative, not just for the music but for the connections formed among participants. \",\"assistant\",[180]],[\"s105\",\"d11\",1240,1586,\"In these sessions, individual stories intertwine, creating a rich tapestry of shared experiences and cultural exchange that enhances our understanding of one another. The documentaries you've been watching must be a wonderful resource for exploring the historical context and the socio-political nuances that inform different musical traditions. \",\"assistant\",[180]],[\"s106\",\"d11\",1586,1824,\"It’s remarkable how music has evolved and adapted, often reflecting the struggles and triumphs of the people who create it, not to mention how it has the power to bring communities together, transcending barriers of language and culture. \",\"assistant\",[180]],[\"s107\",\"d11\",1824,2066,\"I’d love to hear more about what specific cultural music traditions you’ve discovered through your documentaries or if any particular pieces resonate with you on a personal level, as each piece often carries its own unique story and essence. \",\"assistant\",[180]],[\"s108\",\"d11\",2066,2257,\"Your journey into the world of music history can only deepen that connection, and it would be interesting to discuss how these influences might shape your own musical endeavors in the future.\",\"assistant\",[180]],[\"s109\",\"d12\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 168–169 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s110\",\"d12\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s111\",\"d12\",107,504,\"User: I found that my reviews were often criticized for not being objective, which made me less engaged in the process. It felt like I was constantly under the microscope, where every word I wrote was scrutinized by people who often missed the nuance of my opinion. This external pressure led me to second-guess not only my thoughts but also my emotional connection to the music I was discussing. \",\"user\",[168]],[\"s112\",\"d12\",504,830,\"In the end, I realized that the joy I once found in sharing my perspective on albums was overshadowed by the fear of backlash, and that’s a heavy burden for anyone. It became clearer to me that my passion for music needed to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, which is something I’m finally starting to embrace.\",\"user\",[168]],[\"s113\",\"d12\",830,843,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s114\",\"d12\",843,1092,\"Assistant: That’s understandable. Focusing on your artistic expression is more important than fitting into external expectations. Art and music should ultimately be about how they resonate with you and the experiences you wish to share with others. \",\"assistant\",[169]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"music_history\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_4003bdfd9aa4fccf10cf65dc\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s47\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"]}},\"repair_scope\":{\"failed\":[{\"variable\":\"music_history\",\"id\":\"*\",\"feedback\":\"Provider explicitly truncated reasoning output\",\"observation\":null,\"slot\":null}],\"attempt\":1,\"previous_response_identity\":\"fa02844a7dcc6986b01af34bff631b89d3620cb04fbeb98334fe38cf14ec296d\",\"invalid_response\":\"{\\n  \\\"slots\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"variable\\\": \\\"music_history\\\",\\n      \\\"observations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"fact_4003bdfd9aa4fccf10cf65dc\\\",\\n          \\\"stance\\\": \\\"support\\\",\\n          \\\"value\\\": \\\"The user has explored various genres and attended festivals, including an electronic music festival in 2017. They tried learning music theory in 2018 but found it unfulfilling, preferring emotional connection over technical analysis. They attempted researching historical music trends in 2020, which felt tedious. They also explored audio production techniques but found it a chore. They have created their own tracks, which brings joy and satisfaction. They watched a music documentary that felt unsatisfying. They have not played an instrument or composed in a formal sense, but they have engaged in creative activities like making playlists and creating original music. They have also blended nature sounds into their music, shared knowledge with young musicians