ssive consumption like documentaries (s22, s23). No time, resource, or social constraints are mentioned.\",\n          \"summary_revision\": {\n            \"supersedes_route_ids\": [\n              \"fact_a1ba769107e8875f49d042bc\"\n            ],\n            \"previous_version\": 1,\n            \"reason\": \"Re-reading all original sources confirms the same historical facts, preferences, and constraints. No new evidence or counterevidence is present. This revision idempotently retains",
