            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's stated or implied goals for deepening their musical expression, such as learning, performing, sharing, or creating?\",\"output_slot\":\"goals\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's stated or implied goals for deepening their musical expression, such as learning, performing, sharing, or creating?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"4f31b0a5e5a42115a888f0cc4fa32fd9cca151e7694e54fd74c94a3e41268d1a\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"38abc1cbe6f4e54345cbc51b5cecca318db8ffa7e8cb4a29004943cbf6199004\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"ebe16fc62762fbc36d68aff3114babb2e96faf4ed37adf65ab0c54b2a80c954c\"},\"variables\":{\"goals\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"goals\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"goals\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"goals\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_93cb598879324dad103d61ea\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user's stated and implied goals for deepening their musical expression include: creating original music as a personal emotional outlet and form of self-expression; connecting with their cultural heritage and personal identity through music; exploring different genres and the cultural significance behind musical styles; attending live performances to feel the energy and connection; discovering album artwork, lyrics, and stories behind songs; making mood-based playlists; and sharing their work publicly to engage with listeners and collaborate. They explicitly reject technical dissection (music theory, audio production, historical research) as unfulfilling, preferring emotional and experiential engagement.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s59\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user consistently expresses a desire for emotional, creative, and culturally connected musical expression across multiple conversations. They describe finding joy in creating their own tracks (s45, s46), connecting with heritage (s55, s56), exploring genres and cultural significance (s13), attending live performances (s13), and discovering stories behind songs (s14). They also consider sharing work publicly (s59). They explicitly reject technical approaches like music theory (s3, s4), audio production (s43, s44), and historical research (s10, s11, s12) as stressful or unfulfilling. The summary captures these positive goals and negative experiences as a coherent whole.\",\"variable\":\"goals\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s43\",\"d4\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s44\",\"d4\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s45\",\"d4\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s46\",\"d4\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s47\",\"d4\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s55\",\"d5\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s56\",\"d5\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]],[\"s59\",\"d5\",1136,1386,\"Have you thought about sharing your work more publicly? For instance, setting up an online platform could broaden your audience, and it might provide an opportunity for meaningful engagement with listeners who share similar backgrounds or interests. \",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s61\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 81–82 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s62\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d6\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s64\",\"d6\",344,695,\"Moments spent in 