            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\\nEstablished music_history: The user has explored various genres and attended festivals, including an electronic music festival in 2017. They tried learning music theory in 2018 but found it unfulfilling, preferring emotional connection over technical analysis. They attempted researching historical music trends in 2020, which felt tedious. They also explored audio production techniques but found it a chore. They have created their own tracks, which brings joy and satisfaction. They watched a music documentary that felt unsatisfying. They have not played an instrument or composed in a formal sense, but they have engaged in creative activities like making playlists and creating original music. They have also blended nature sounds into their music, shared knowledge with young musicians, integrated their cultural heritage into compositions, developed an app to help others blend traditional and modern music, found a book on Pacific music that reignited their interest, participated in collaborative music sessions, and faced criticism when writing music reviews, which led them to focus on more personal expression.\\nEstablished current_constraints: The user prefers emotional, personal, and creative engagement with music over technical or analytical approaches. They have found fulfillment in creating their own tracks, exploring their cultural heritage, and connecting music to personal experiences and emotions. They have tried and rejected music theory, historical research, and audio production as too technical or uninspiring. They enjoy attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, making playlists, and composing original music. They have no reported time, resource, or social constraints that limit their engagement.\\nEstablished goals: The user's stated and implied goals for deepening their musical expression include: creating original music as a personal emotional outlet and form of self-expression; connecting with their cultural heritage and personal identity through music; exploring different genres and the cultural significance behind musical styles; attending live performances to feel the energy and connection; discovering album artwork, lyrics, and stories behind songs; making mood-based playlists; and sharing their work publicly to engage with listeners and collaborate. They explicitly reject technical dissection (music theory, audio production, historical research) as unfulfilling, preferring emotional and experiential engagement.\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"fe06b8af60e68374fc78c376e806fb465a9150774a43de3ccadec8774bf25c50\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"38abc1cbe6f4e54345cbc51b5cecca318db8ffa7e8cb4a29004943cbf6199004\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"ebe16fc62762fbc36d68aff3114babb2e96faf4ed37adf65ab0c54b2a80c954c\"},\"variables\":{\"music_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"current_constraints\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"goals\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"goals\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"response\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"response\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_s