            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"6313565c1d4777709a79605729233f578e2f9cccf3876856d6b096ff4ece7557\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"38abc1cbe6f4e54345cbc51b5cecca318db8ffa7e8cb4a29004943cbf6199004\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"ebe16fc62762fbc36d68aff3114babb2e96faf4ed37adf65ab0c54b2a80c954c\"},\"variables\":{\"music_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"current_constraints\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"goals\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"goals\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"response\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"response\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"music_history\",\"current_constraints\",\"goals\",\"response\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"music_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"current_constraints\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"goals\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"response\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{\"music_history\":{\"value\":\"The user has explored various genres and attended festivals, including an electronic music festival in 2017. They tried learning music theory in 2018 but found it unfulfilling, preferring emotional connection over technical analysis. They attempted researching historical music trends in 2020, which felt tedious. They also explored audio production techniques but found it a chore. They have created their own tracks, which brings joy and satisfaction. They watched a music documentary that felt unsatisfying. They have not played an instrument or composed in a formal sense, but they have engaged in creative activities like making playlists and creating original music. They have also blended nature sounds into their music, shared knowledge with young musicians, integrated their cultural heritage into compositions, developed an app to help others blend traditional and modern music, found a book on Pacific music that reignited their interest, participated in collaborative music sessions, and faced criticism when writing music reviews, which led them to focus on more personal expression.\",\"version\":2,\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s111\",\"s92\",\"s11\",\"s81\",\"s93\",\"s63\",\"s100\",\"s80\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s82\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s55\",\"s73\",\"s101\",\"s102\",\"s65\",\"s47\",\"s112\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s64\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s74\",\"s56\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"demand\":\"music_history\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"current_constraints\":{\"value\":\"The user prefers emotional, personal, and creative engagement with music over technical or analytical approaches. They have found fulfillment in creating their own tracks, exploring their cultural heritage, and connecting music to personal experiences and emotions. They have tried and rejected music theory, historical research, and audio production as too technical or uninspiring. They enjoy attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, making playlists, and composing original music. They have no reported time, resource, or social constraints that limit their engagement.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"demand\":\"current_constraints\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"goals\":{\"value\":\"The user's stated and implied goals for deepening their musical expression include: creating original music as a personal emotional outlet and form of self-expression; connecting with their cultural heritage and personal identity through music; exploring different genres and the cultural significance behind musical styles; attending live performances to feel the energy and connection; discovering album artwork, lyrics, and stories behind songs; making mood-based playlists; and sharing their work publicly to engage with listeners and collaborate. They explicitly reject technical dissection (music theory, audio production, historical research) as unfulfilling, preferring emotional and experiential engagement.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s59\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"demand\":\"goals\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_4003bdfd9aa4fccf10cf65dc\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has explored various genres and attended festivals, including an electronic music festival in 2017. They tried learning music theory in 2018 but found it unfulfilling, preferring emotional connection over technical analysis. They attempted researching historical music trends in 2020, which felt tedious. They also explored audio production techniques but found it a chore. They have created their own tracks, which brings joy and satisfaction. They watched a music documentary that felt unsatisfying. They have not played an instrument or composed in a formal sense, but they have engaged in creative activities like making playlists and creating original music.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s47\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's statements across multiple conversations describe past experiences with music: attending an electronic music festival in 2017 (s31, s32), trying music theory in 2018 (s33, s34), researching historical music trends in 2020 (s10, s11), exploring audio production (s43, s44), creating their own tracks (s45, s46, s47), watching a documentary (s22, s23, s47), and engaging with genres, playlists, and cultural exploration (s3, s4, s13, s14). No instrument playing or formal composition is mentioned.\",\"variable\":\"music_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"superseded_by\":[\"fact_eea96da5ed6aec3e471036e5\"]},{\"id\":\"fact_eea96da5ed6aec3e471036e5\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has explored various genres and attended festivals, including an electronic music festival in 2017. They tried learning music theory in 2018 but found it unfulfilling, preferring emotional connection over technical analysis. They attempted researching historical music trends in 2020, which felt tedious. They also explored audio production techniques but found it a chore. They have created their own tracks, which brings joy and satisfaction. They watched a music documentary that felt unsatisfying. They have not played an instrument or composed in a formal sense, but they have engaged in creative activities like making playlists and creating original music. They have also blended nature sounds into their music, shared knowledge with young musicians, integrated their cultural heritage into compositions, developed an app to help others blend traditional and modern music, found a book on Pacific music that reignited their interest, participated in collaborative music sessions, and faced criticism when writing music reviews, which led them to focus on more personal expression.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s111\",\"s92\",\"s11\",\"s81\",\"s93\",\"s63\",\"s100\",\"s80\",\"s31\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s82\",\"s3\",\"s33\",\"s55\",\"s73\",\"s101\",\"s102\",\"s65\",\"s47\",\"s112\",\"s32\",\"s14\",\"s64\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s74\",\"s56\",\"s34\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_4003bdfd9aa4fccf10cf65dc\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporating additional compatible historical evidence from later conversations (nature sounds, teaching, heritage integration, app development, Pacific music book, collaborative sessions, and review criticism) into a single comprehensive summary, while retaining all original sources and factual content.\"},\"reason\":\"The user's statements across multiple conversations describe past experiences with music: attending an electronic music festival in 2017 (s31, s32), trying music theory in 2018 (s33, s34), researching historical music trends in 2020 (s10, s11), exploring audio production (s43, s44), creating their own tracks (s45, s46, s47), watching a documentary (s22, s23, s47), and engaging with genres, playlists, and cultural exploration (s3, s4, s13, s14). Additional evidence shows blending nature sounds (s63, s64, s65), teaching young musicians (s73, s74), integrating cultural heritage (s55, s56), developing an app (s80, s81, s82), finding a Pacific music book (s92, s93), collaborative sessions (s100, s101, s102), and facing criticism in music reviews (s111, s112). No instrument playing or formal composition is mentioned.\",\"variable\":\"music_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_a1ba769107e8875f49d042bc\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user prefers emotional, personal, and creative engagement with music over technical or analytical approaches. They have found fulfillment in creating their own tracks, exploring their cultural heritage, and connecting music to personal experiences and emotions. They have tried and rejected music theory, historical research, and audio production as too technical or uninspiring. They enjoy attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, making playlists, and composing original music. They have no reported time, resource, or social constraints that limit their engagement.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user consistently expresses a preference for emotional and creative music engagement over technical analysis. They describe losing interest in music theory (s3, s4), finding historical research tedious (s10, s11, s12), and audio production feeling like a chore (s43, s44). They report enjoying live performances, exploring genres and cultural significance, album artwork and lyrics, and making playlists (s13, s14). They find fulfillment in creating their own tracks (s45, s46, s47) and connecting with their heritage through music (s55, s56). They also express disappointment with passive consumption like documentaries (s22, s23). No time, resource, or social constraints are mentioned.\",\"variable\":\"current_constraints\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_93cb598879324dad103d61ea\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user's stated and implied goals for deepening their musical expression include: creating original music as a personal emotional outlet and form of self-expression; connecting with their cultural heritage and personal identity through music; exploring different genres and the cultural significance behind musical styles; attending live performances to feel the energy and connection; discovering album artwork, lyrics, and stories behind songs; making mood-based playlists; and sharing their work publicly to engage with listeners and collaborate. They explicitly reject technical dissection (music theory, audio production, historical research) as unfulfilling, preferring emotional and experiential engagement.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s22\",\"s23\",\"s11\",\"s12\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s4\",\"s3\",\"s55\",\"s47\",\"s59\",\"s14\",\"s10\",\"s43\",\"s56\",\"s45\",\"s44\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user consistently expresses a desire for emotional, creative, and culturally connected musical expression across multiple conversations. They describe finding joy in creating their own tracks (s45, s46), connecting with heritage (s55, s56), exploring genres and cultural significance (s13), attending live performances (s13), and discovering stories behind songs (s14). They also consider sharing work publicly (s59). They explicitly reject technical approaches like music theory (s3, s4), audio production (s43, s44), and historical research (s10, s11, s12) as stressful or unfulfilling. The summary captures these positive goals and negative experiences as a coherent whole.\",\"variable\":\"goals\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_5943dc85f20743e5562cad6c\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"Collaborating with others who share your musical interests can also be a rewarding path. A user found fulfillment through working with musicians from diverse backgrounds, mixing traditional and electronic elements to expand their creative horizons. Such group efforts can enhance not only your musical explorations but also build lasting relationships, as you contribute unique perspectives to a collective musical vision.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s81\",\"s100\",\"s80\",\"s46\",\"s13\",\"s82\",\"s55\",\"s73\",\"s101\",\"s14\",\"s74\",\"s56\",\"s45\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{\"music_history\":2,\"current_constraints\":1,\"goals\":1},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's history and goals strongly align with option (c). They have found fulfillment in collaborative music sessions (s100, s101), integrating cultural heritage (s55, s56), developing an app to blend traditional and modern music (s80, s81, s82), and teaching young musicians (s73, s74). They enjoy creating original tracks (s45, s46) and exploring genres and cultural significance (s13, s14). They explicitly reject technical/analytical approaches (music theory, audio production, historical research) as unfulfilling, which eliminates options (b) and (d). Option (a) is generic and does not leverage the user's demonstrated passion for collaboration and cultural fusion. Option (c) directly matches the user's positive experiences and stated goals of collaborative, culturally-connected, creative expression.\",\"variable\":\"response\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",105,364,\"User: Yes, I attended another festival in 2017 that showcased electronic music, which was also eye-opening. The creativity displayed at that festival was nothing short of spectacular, with artists pushing the boundaries of sound in ways I had never imagined. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",364,655,\"There were vibrant visuals accompanying the music, and it felt like each performance was not just an auditory experience, but also a feast for the eyes. The diversity of electronic subgenres was a revelation; it really made me appreciate how broad and eclectic the music landscape is today. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",655,985,\"Each artist brought their own unique flavor, and it was thrilling to see how they engaged with the audience in real-time.\\n\\nUser: However, I realized that analyzing music theory wasn't my forte in 2018. As I sat through various classes, I found myself more focused on the emotional aspects of music rather than the technicalities. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",985,1287,\"It became evident that while I loved understanding how music is composed, diving into the intricacies of scales, modes, and harmonic structures just didn't resonate with me. Perhaps it was the way I primarily experienced music— through listening and feeling rather than dissecting the notes on a page. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",1136,1386,\"Have you thought about sharing your work more publicly? For instance, setting up an online platform could broaden your audience, and it might provide an opportunity for meaningful engagement with listeners who share similar backgrounds or interests. \",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s65\",\"d7\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s73\",\"d8\",105,418,\"User: It was fulfilling to share knowledge and inspire others. The joy that comes from seeing the lightbulb moment when someone understands a new concept is incredibly rewarding. Sharing my experiences and insights felt like passing on a torch, igniting curiosity and passion in the next generation of musicians. \",\"user\",[16]],[\"s74\",\"d8\",418,663,\"It was heartwarming to witness the enthusiasm and creativity bubbling up from young talents who were eager to learn. Each interaction was a reminder of the beauty of music and how it can connect people across various backgrounds and experiences.\",\"user\",[16]],[\"s80\",\"d9\",105,408,\"User: Now, I’m focusing on blending my traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app that helps others do the same. This exciting endeavor allows me to explore the rich heritage of my musical upbringing while also embracing contemporary genres that resonate with today's audiences. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s81\",\"d9\",408,640,\"By experimenting with various elements, such as instrumentation and digital production techniques, I am able to create a unique sound that pays homage to my roots while also pushing the boundaries of what is traditionally expected. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s82\",\"d9\",640,1002,\"Additionally, this app I am developing aims not only to assist me but also to empower others who share similar aspirations by providing tools, tutorials, and resources that inspire creativity. I believe that by combining our musical histories with modern technology, we can create something truly transformative, both personally and in the wider music community.\",\"user\",[45]],[\"s92\",\"d10\",105,484,\"User: I found a new book that explains concepts through Pacific music examples, and it really ignited my interest! The book goes into incredible detail about the unique scales and timbres that are characteristic of Pacific Islander music, which is just fascinating to me. It's amazing how music can not only entertain but also teach us about the history and culture of a region. \",\"user\",[52]],[\"s93\",\"d10\",484,668,\"I have always wanted to understand more about my own heritage, and this book provided that bridge. I feel like I am taking steps toward a richer connection with my roots through music.\",\"user\",[52]],[\"s100\",\"d11\",107,486,\"User: It was an enriching experience, and we created some exciting pieces together! The energy in the room was palpable as musicians from different backgrounds shared their unique styles and techniques, weaving together melodies that resonated with everyone present. Each note seemed to tell a story, reflecting the diverse cultural influences that shaped the sounds we created. \",\"user\",[179]],[\"s101\",\"d11\",486,666,\"I found it fascinating how music can serve as a universal language, bridging gaps and fostering connections among individuals who may come from completely different walks of life. \",\"user\",[179]],[\"s102\",\"d11\",666,919,\"Lately, I've been delving deeper into this theme by watching a series of documentaries that showcase the evolution of cultural music around the world, exploring how geography, history, and social movements have influenced various genres throughout time.\",\"user\",[179]],[\"s111\",\"d12\",107,504,\"User: I found that my reviews were often criticized for not being objective, which made me less engaged in the process. It felt like I was constantly under the microscope, where every word I wrote was scrutinized by people who often missed the nuance of my opinion. This external pressure led me to second-guess not only my thoughts but also my emotional connection to the music I was discussing. \",\"user\",[168]],[\"s112\",\"d12\",504,830,\"In the end, I realized that the joy I once found in sharing my perspective on albums was overshadowed by the fear of backlash, and that’s a heavy burden for anyone. It became clearer to me that my passion for music needed to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, which is something I’m finally starting to embrace.\",\"user\",[168]]],\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"public_output_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"public_options\":[\"You might consider exploring different avenues like writing about your musical journey or experimenting with performing live in settings that inspire you. Also, giving yourself the freedom to simply enjoy music without external pressures could rekindle your passion.\",\"Exploring sound engineering might offer a fulfilling way to express your love for music. Like one user who was inspired by a chance meeting with an audio engineer at a festival, you could dive into the world of creating digital music remixes. By blending different influences and styles, you may find inspiration in exploring the nuances of sound capturing and creating unique auditory landscapes that surpass traditional music boundaries.\",\"Collaborating with others who share your musical interests can also be a rewarding path. A user found fulfillment through working with musicians from diverse backgrounds, mixing traditional and electronic elements to expand their creative horizons. Such group efforts can enhance not only your musical explorations but also build lasting relationships, as you contribute unique perspectives to a collective musical vision.\",\"Consider getting involved in music criticism by writing album reviews. As highlighted by a diligent user after attending a workshop, reviews can be instrumental in shaping listener perspectives and enhancing understanding. By delving deeper into the contexts and intentions behind albums, you can enrich your musical experience and articulate your insights, potentially helping others to connect more deeply with the music.\"],\"terminal_expression\":{\"op\":\"var\",\"id\":\"response\"},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"response_audit\",\"audit_instruction\":\"Check actual facts and ALL known scoped counters against original sources. Return audit_verdict=supported only if checked with no unresolve